## Teratricus

A teratricus is a great mass of fungus, mottled and broken out in short green growths that catch the light and look smooth against the rest. It has no front or back. An orifice opens somewhere on it and fires a tight bundle of spores, and the spores that land stick and slow a body and leave a blight in the blood. Its own wounds knit closed and the fungus spreads while it stands. It is not a plant, and no drug, no sleep, no sickness and no spell of the mind takes hold of it.

One stood among the sards in the [[Geography/Althane/Realms/Ilkyne|City of Yellow]].
